OL,3,GNEWSAPolice commissioner may cancel
OL,4,Atour after backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorfolk's police commissioner is
OL,7,Fconsidering scrapping his 127-date
OL,8,Ftheatre show after a backlash from
OL,9,Flocal people, he has told the BBC.
OL,11,FSince announcing his UK-wide true crime
OL,12,Ftour, Colin Sutton said constituents
OL,13,Fhad emailed him with concerns about his
OL,14,Fability to perform his day job.
OL,16,FHe was elected to the #79,000-a-year
OL,17,Fpost on a Reform UK ticket in July and
OL,18,Fannounced the gig two months later.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
